  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 936136704
    m_Localized: 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 965496832
    m_Localized: Eri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691136
    m_Localized: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691137
    m_Localized: "Oh! A ship! Nobody has crashed here in ages\u2026 I mean, come
      here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691138
    m_Localized: 'I''m Eri. This planet is mine: the soil is mine, the hands are
      yours.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691139
    m_Localized: Pick a farmer and a scythe. We'll handle the rest together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691140
    m_Localized: "The field is empty\u2026 Buy a planter from the shop first, then
      start the round."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691141
    m_Localized: Click an empty spot and the planter settles in. Press R to rotate
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691142
    m_Localized: Don't know how to harvest? Keep the cursor over the plants; the
      scythe swings by itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691143
    m_Localized: "Didn't Earth have automatic scythes? I could have sworn it did\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691144
    m_Localized: That share at the top left is my Offering. Fill it before the period
      ends, okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691145
    m_Localized: You're growing! Pick one; it stays with you for this harvest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691146
    m_Localized: "Last round of the period. My Offering is still short\u2026 hurry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691147
    m_Localized: "Mmm\u2026 I'm full."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691148
    m_Localized: For now. My next share will be a little bigger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691149
    m_Localized: This round is a Trial! Reach the target on the left within this
      round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691150
    m_Localized: One of my seeds has gone wild! What it does is written on the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691151
    m_Localized: "The Offering fell short. Hunger\u2026 doesn't wait."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691152
    m_Localized: We'll start again. The soil is always here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691153
    m_Localized: "You didn't pass the Trial\u2026 And I can't wait either."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691154
    m_Localized: You'll be back. I know it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691155
    m_Localized: I'm full. Really, this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691156
    m_Localized: "\u2026It won't last, though."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691157
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 969691158
    m_Localized: "Mmm\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148337693839360
    m_Localized: "BASE \u2192 WITH CARD  \xB7  EXAMPLE"
