    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151479533719600
    m_Localized: A brief slow-down of time as the timer runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151479533719601
    m_Localized: Screen Flashes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 151479533719602
    m_Localized: The white screen flash at the end of a round. Turn it off if you
      are sensitive to light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
