    m_Localized: PLACE THE ANTENNA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898158
    m_Localized: "Pick a spot on the field edge \xB7 the antenna faces inward"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898159
    m_Localized: "the edge antenna hits the first {0:plural:{} cell|{} cells} it
      faces every {1} s \xB7 {2}% of harvest damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 221144893936370180
  - m_Id: 227725751898160
    m_Localized: "if the line harvests a plant of a planter with a behavior, an extra
      line hit at that planter's behavior chance \xB7 {0}% of the damage \xB7 cooldown
      {1} s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898161
    m_Localized: SECOND ANTENNA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898162
    m_Localized: Goes on the opposite edge, in line with the first antenna
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898163
    m_Localized: "a second antenna on the opposite edge, in line \xB7 line hits on
      the cells between the antennas every {0} s \xB7 {1}% of harvest damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898164
    m_Localized: "every {0} direct plant hits, a crescent from the cursor \xB7 random
      main direction, up to {1} units \xB7 {2}% of harvest damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898165
    m_Localized: "a crescent every {0} valid hits \xB7 travels {1:plural:{} cell|{}
      cells} \xB7 {2}% of harvest damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 221144893936370180
  - m_Id: 227725751898166
    m_Localized: "a crit arcs to another plant within {0:plural:{} cell|{} cells}
      \xB7 {1}% of crit damage \xB7 up to {2} per hit"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 221144893936370180
  - m_Id: 227725751898167
    m_Localized: "crit on {0}+ plants in one hit: extra area hit at the center \xB7
      {1}% of harvest damage \xD7 crit multiplier"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898168
    m_Localized: "each main crescent sends a big extra crescent from the cursor ring
      \xB7 random direction, not the main one \xB7 {0}% of base damage \xB7 cost:
      {1} s hit pause"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898169
    m_Localized: "{0}+ harvests in one hit: next hit's damage \xD7{1} \xB7 hit a
      single target and the charge is lost"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898170
    m_Localized: "crescent range +{0} units \xB7 grows with harvests: damage +{1}%
      (up to {2} times), front {3} cells \xB7 a step without a harvest resets it"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898171
    m_Localized: "{0}+ harvests in one hit: meteors on the cells mirrored across
      the field center (up to {1}) \xB7 {2}% of harvest damage \xB7 cooldown {3}
      s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898172
    m_Localized: "{0}% of a killing hit's leftover damage passes to the next plant
      \xB7 up to {1} transfers \xB7 {2}% lost per transfer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898173
    m_Localized: "a triggered planter behavior runs once more {0} s later \xB7 {1}%
      of the damage \xB7 {2} s cooldown per planter + behavior"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725751898174
    m_Localized: "harvest a {0}-or-better plant with your own hit: current behavior
      chances \xD7{2} for {1} s \xB7 doesn't stack, the timer refreshes"
