  - m_Id: 227725756092416
    m_Localized: Offered after the Round 25 boss; taken once. Floor 0.10 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092417
    m_Localized: Wide Swing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092418
    m_Localized: Hit radius
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092419
    m_Localized: Only your own hit. The cursor ring grows; behavior area unchanged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092420
    m_Localized: Quick Wrist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092421
    m_Localized: Attack interval
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092422
    m_Localized: attack rate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092423
    m_Localized: Shorter time between hits. Floor 0.10 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092424
    m_Localized: Sharp Blade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092425
    m_Localized: Direct hit damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092426
    m_Localized: Only your own hit. Behavior damage unchanged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092427
    m_Localized: Spark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092428
    m_Localized: Current behavior chances
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092429
    m_Localized: "Explosion \xB7 tornado \xB7 boomerang \xB7 electric. Gives no chance
      to a planter that has none; up to 100%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092430
    m_Localized: Critical Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092431
    m_Localized: Crit chance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092432
    m_Localized: Only your own hit. Added as percentage points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092433
    m_Localized: Rare Seed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092434
    m_Localized: Rarity bonus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092435
    m_Localized: All planters. Added as percentage points; up to 95 points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092436
    m_Localized: Destructive Force
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092437
    m_Localized: Behavior damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092438
    m_Localized: "Explosion \xB7 tornado \xB7 boomerang \xB7 electric. Your own hit
      is unchanged."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092439
    m_Localized: Greedy Harvest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092440
    m_Localized: 'Greed:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092441
    m_Localized: An empty swing doesn't spend the charge. The powered hit doesn't
      earn a new charge. Doesn't carry over to behaviors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092442
    m_Localized: Overload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092443
    m_Localized: 'Load:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092444
    m_Localized: The extra proc doesn't join the chain or roll again. The tornado
      / boomerang active limit isn't exceeded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092445
    m_Localized: Growing Moon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092446
    m_Localized: 'Growth:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092447
    m_Localized: "Crescent range +1 unit: 3 \u2192 4. The main crescent grows with
      the distance it travels, from birth until it fades; it doesn't wait for the
      first harvest. Damage growth depends on real harvests. Full Moon is big from
      the start and stays that size."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092448
    m_Localized: Full Moon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092449
    m_Localized: 'Full Moon:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092450
    m_Localized: Each main crescent comes with exactly one big extra crescent; no
      harvest needed. It starts from the cursor ring and moves in a random direction
      other than the main one. It is big from the start and makes no further Full
      Moons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092451
    m_Localized: Electric Antenna
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092452
    m_Localized: 'Antenna:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092453
    m_Localized: 'The antenna stands on the field edge; it takes no planter or tile
      space. Its hit doesn''t count as yours: no crits, no behavior triggers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092454
    m_Localized: Harvest Echo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092455
    m_Localized: 'Echo:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092456
    m_Localized: Only harvests from your own hits count. An echo makes no new echo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092457
    m_Localized: Crescent Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092458
    m_Localized: 'Crescent:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092459
    m_Localized: The crescent leaves the cursor ring's edge in a random main direction.
      Speed 8 units/s; base range 3, 4 with Growing Moon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092460
    m_Localized: Conductive Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092461
    m_Localized: 'Line:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092462
    m_Localized: You choose where the second antenna goes; spots where no line can
      form can't be chosen. Line hits don't count as yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092463
    m_Localized: Closed Circuit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092464
    m_Localized: 'Circuit:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092465
    m_Localized: The extra hit can't restart itself. Does nothing without a planter
      that has a behavior.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092466
    m_Localized: Critical Arc
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092467
    m_Localized: 'Arc:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092468
    m_Localized: The arc goes to a plant your hit didn't touch. It doesn't crit or
      make new arcs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092469
    m_Localized: Rare Reactor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092470
    m_Localized: 'Reactor:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092471
    m_Localized: "Explosion \xB7 tornado \xB7 boomerang \xB7 electric. Gives no chance
      to a planter that has none; up to 100%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092472
    m_Localized: Overflow Damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092473
    m_Localized: 'Overflow:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092474
    m_Localized: Starts only from a plant killed by your own hit. Transfers don't
      crit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092475
    m_Localized: Aftershock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092476
    m_Localized: 'Aftershock:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092477
    m_Localized: Spreads three steps from the explosion's outer edge. Hits each cell
      once; doesn't pass locked cells. An aftershock starts no new aftershock or
      chain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092478
    m_Localized: Double Current
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092479
    m_Localized: 'Second electric wave:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725756092480
    m_Localized: After every normal electric that procs, a second wave from the same
      planter. No new roll; the second wave starts no chain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
