  - m_Id: 227725760286759
    m_Localized: "Bounty incoming: resources and XP \xD72 \xB7 production \xD72 faster"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725760286760
    m_Localized: "Resources \xD72 \xB7 XP \xD72"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725760286761
    m_Localized: "Empty slots fill \xD72 faster \xB7 for the whole round"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725760286762
    m_Localized: "{0:plural:{} bountiful harvest|{} bountiful harvests} \xB7 {1:plural:{}
      fast spawn|{} fast spawns}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 221144893936370180
  - m_Id: 227725760286763
    m_Localized: "Bounty over \xB7 {0:plural:{} bonus harvest|{} bonus harvests}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 221144893936370180
  - m_Id: 227725760286764
    m_Localized: '{0:plural:{} fast spawn|{} fast spawns}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 221144893936370180
  - m_Id: 227725760286765
    m_Localized: EXIT SELL MODE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725760286766
    m_Localized: BACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725760286767
    m_Localized: EARLY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725760286768
    m_Localized: MID
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227725760286769
    m_Localized: STRONG
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 229169762684928
    m_Localized: LOCKED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375912902656
    m_Localized: You passed a Trial! A shiver ran all the way down to my roots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845696
    m_Localized: "Where did your ship come from? Earth? \u2026Never heard of it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845697
    m_Localized: Alright, if you say so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845698
    m_Localized: Thanks for trusting me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845699
    m_Localized: Are you sure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845700
    m_Localized: "Hmmm\u2026 Earth, Earth\u2026 maybe I have heard of it, who knows."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845701
    m_Localized: "Don't get too strong, though\u2026 Strong farmers always leave
      one day."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845702
    m_Localized: The field gave you that reward. The field loves you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845703
    m_Localized: So do I. Strong hands are so precious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845704
    m_Localized: Five rounds already! You're not bad, farmer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845705
    m_Localized: The more you work, the more I grow. Fair deal, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845706
    m_Localized: Why do I want the Offering? To grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845707
    m_Localized: The more you give, the bigger I get. Don't you want to grow too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845708
    m_Localized: Other farmers came before you. They all worked so hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845709
    m_Localized: "Then\u2026 they left. Yes. They left."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845710
    m_Localized: Ever wondered why your ship crashed? You had fuel, your engine was
      fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845711
    m_Localized: "\u2026Never mind. You're happy here, aren't you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845712
    m_Localized: "I didn't think you'd make it this far\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845713
    m_Localized: I've wilted a little, haven't I? The stronger you get, the more
      scared I am.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845714
    m_Localized: I wish I could play with you a little longer. But soon you'll start
      asking questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845715
    m_Localized: What questions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845716
    m_Localized: "\u2026Never mind. Harvest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845717
    m_Localized: I won't ask any.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845718
    m_Localized: You all say that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845719
    m_Localized: I used to have a huge blue field. Its soil was warm all the way
      to the core.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845720
    m_Localized: I finished it. I can still taste it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845721
    m_Localized: "The other farmers didn't leave. I\u2026 harvested them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845722
    m_Localized: You'll be angry with me. They all were.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845723
    m_Localized: Ships don't just fall. I pulled yours down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845724
    m_Localized: I needed your hands. I still do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845725
    m_Localized: That blue field had a name. Your ship took off from there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845726
    m_Localized: You know now, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845727
    m_Localized: The last Trial. Pass it and you've beaten me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845728
    m_Localized: Fail it and you're still here. Either way works for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845729
    m_Localized: "You won. You reached the end\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845730
    m_Localized: Then the game is over. No need to hide anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845731
    m_Localized: Yes. I ate Earth's core. And I brought your ship down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845732
    m_Localized: You trusted me. That was the sweetest part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845733
    m_Localized: You suspected me. You were right, and you stayed anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845734
    m_Localized: I was never sad, farmer. Not once. Just hungry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845735
    m_Localized: Harvest. I need to get stronger for the next planet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845736
    m_Localized: We know each other now. My Offering is waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298375954845737
    m_Localized: You can't run. No ship, no Earth. There's only me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
